		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρο-τηρέω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς μεταβολάς</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>observe the seasons</i> of
			change, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.22
			</span></i>: generally, <i>lie in wait for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς ἀσχολουμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAmh.</u>
					2.35.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				19.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>:— also in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τηρησάμενός με ἐξερχόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					909.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>:</div>
